{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06940","headline":"古兴 · 常建","name":"古兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辘轳井上双梧桐，飞鸟衔花日将没。\n深闺女儿莫愁年，玉指泠泠怨金碧。\n石榴裙裾蛱蝶飞，见人不语颦蛾眉。\n青丝素丝红绿丝，织成锦衾当爲谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}